000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. ROLS6011.
000300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000500 FILE-CONTROL.
000600     SELECT CUSTOMER-FILE ASSIGN TO "data/customers.dat"
000700       ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
000800 DATA DIVISION.
000900 FILE SECTION.
001000 FD CUSTOMER-FILE.
001100 01 CUSTOMER-FILE-REC.
001200    05 F-CUS-ID PIC 9(6).
001300    05 F-CUS-NAME PIC X(30).
001400    05 F-CUS-STATUS PIC X(10).
001500 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001600 COPY CPM-CUSTOMER.
001700 01 WS-EOF PIC X VALUE SPACE.
001800 01 WS-MAX-ID PIC 9(6) VALUE 0.
001900 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002000 MAIN.
002100     ACCEPT CUS-NAME
002200     PERFORM ASSIGN-NEXT-ID
002300     MOVE 'ACTIVE' TO CUS-STATUS
002400     MOVE CUS-ID TO F-CUS-ID
002500     MOVE CUS-NAME TO F-CUS-NAME
002600     MOVE CUS-STATUS TO F-CUS-STATUS
002700     OPEN EXTEND CUSTOMER-FILE
002800     WRITE CUSTOMER-FILE-REC
002900     CLOSE CUSTOMER-FILE
003000     DISPLAY "OK CUSTOMER STORED ID " CUS-ID
003100     EXIT PROGRAM.
003200 ASSIGN-NEXT-ID.
003300     MOVE 0 TO WS-MAX-ID
003400     MOVE SPACE TO WS-EOF
003500     OPEN INPUT CUSTOMER-FILE
003600     PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
003700       READ CUSTOMER-FILE
003800         AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
003900         NOT AT END
004000           IF F-CUS-ID > WS-MAX-ID
004100              MOVE F-CUS-ID TO WS-MAX-ID
004200           END-IF
004300       END-READ
004400     END-PERFORM
004500     CLOSE CUSTOMER-FILE
004600     ADD 1 TO WS-MAX-ID
004700     MOVE WS-MAX-ID TO CUS-ID.
